	(text_box "Adafruit is using a 5K resistor for r21, which gives less current \n(196 instead of 50mA) in the IBat =>  slower charge but less heat\nand some small batteries can be dammaged by too much current. \nNeed to adjust once we chose the battery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
